@startuml
title Wallet Entity Model

class Wallet {
  **Primary Key**
  --
  + ID : ObjectID
  --
  **Wallet Details**
  --
  + Name : string
  + Code : string
  + Avatar : string
  + Services : types.Services
  --
  **Status**
  --
  + Enabled : bool
  + IsDeleted : bool
  --
  **Timestamps**
  --
  + CreatedAt : time.Time
  + LastModifiedAt : time.Time
  + DeletedAt : time.Time
}

note right of Wallet::Services
  Configuration of services 
  enabled for this wallet
end note

note bottom of Wallet
  **Field Descriptions:**
  **Name**: Display name of the wallet
  **Code**: Unique wallet code
  **Avatar**: Icon/Image for the wallet
end note
@enduml
